description:
**Responsibilities:**

* Prepare bank reconciliation and account reconciliation;
* Monitor and drive the performance of accounts department;
* Assist in preparing monthly financial reports;
* Assist in the design and implementation of financial control policies and procedures;
* Assist Finance Manager to ensure smooth finance operation.
* Assist in ad\\-hoc tasks.

**Requirements:**

* F. 6 or above with LCC Certificate;
* Proficiency in MYOB, MS Office, especially in Excel, Word \\& Chinese Word Processing;
* Self\\-motivated and strong organization skills.

Visit our website: beauskinmedical.hk

We offer 5\\-day work week and a competitive package to the right candidates. Interested candidates please send your detailed resume with contact telephone numbers, available date, current and expected salary through "Apply Now". To apply, please contact 3188 8939 or WhatsApp 9695 8949 Human Resources Department for enquiry.

Personal data collected will be used for recruitment purpose only.

工作類型: 全職, 長工

福利：

* 在職專業培訓
* 員工購物優惠
* 晉升機會

Work Location: 親身到場
